# Accepted risks, each with the reason. Review when the design changes.

# The Kubernetes API endpoint is public so that a laptop can reach it without a VPN or bastion host.
# Access is limited to var.api_allowed_cidrs (your own address), which has no default and must be set.
AWS-0040

# Worker nodes need outbound access to pull images and for the app to reach api.osv.dev.
# Egress is further limited inside the cluster by the chart's NetworkPolicy.
AWS-0104
